{"verses":[{"verse":1,"text":"Ee \\nd Bwana\\nd*, mfalme huzifurahia nguvu zako."},{"verse":2,"text":"Umempa haja ya moyo wake"},{"verse":3,"text":"Ulimkaribisha kwa baraka tele"},{"verse":4,"text":"Alikuomba maisha, nawe ukampa,"},{"verse":5,"text":"Kutokana na ushindi uliompa, utukufu wake ni mkubwa,"},{"verse":6,"text":"Hakika umempa baraka za milele,"},{"verse":7,"text":"Kwa kuwa mfalme anamtumaini \\nd Bwana\\nd*;"},{"verse":8,"text":"Mkono wako utawashika adui zako wote,"},{"verse":9,"text":"Wakati utakapojitokeza"},{"verse":10,"text":"Utawaangamiza wazao wao kutoka duniani,"},{"verse":11,"text":"Ingawa watapanga mabaya dhidi yako"},{"verse":12,"text":"kwa kuwa utawafanya wakimbie"},{"verse":13,"text":"Ee \\nd Bwana\\nd*, utukuzwe katika nguvu zako,"}]}